,click_event:{action:change_page,page:17}},"\n","","\n",{text:"OUTSIDER",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue},"\n",{text:"Drunk",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:18}},"\n",{text:"Recluse",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:19}},"\n",{text:"Moonchild",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:20}},"\n",{text:"Barber",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:21}},"\n","","\n",{text:"MINION",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red},"\n",{text:"Poisoner",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:22}},"\n",{text:"Scarlet Woman",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:23}}],["",{text:"      Contents\n",bold:true,italic:false},"\n",{text:"Baron",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:24}},"\n",{text:"Witch",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:25}},"\n","","\n",{text:"DEMON",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red},"\n",{text:"Imp",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:26}},"\n",{text:"Fang Gu",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:27}},"\n","","\n",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:gold},"\n",[{text:"",italic:false,click_event:{action:change_page,page:28}},{text:"Scarlet Woman",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:28}},{text:"/\n   ",italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:28}},{text:"Fang Gu",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:28}}]],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Washerwoman",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"You start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Townsfolk."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Librarian",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"You start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Outsider. (Or that zero are in play.)"],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Investigator",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"You start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Minion."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Chef",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"You start knowing how many pairs of evil players there are."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Empath",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Each night, you learn how many of your 2 alive neighbors are evil."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Fortune Teller",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Each night, choose 2 players: you learn if either is a Demon. There is a good player that registers as a Demon to you."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Undertaker",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Each night*, you learn which character died by execution today."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Monk",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Each night*, choose a player (not yourself): they are safe from the Demon tonight."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Ravenkeeper",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If you die at night, you are woken to choose a player: you learn their character."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Virgin",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"The 1st time you are nominated, if the nominator is a Townsfolk, they are executed immediately."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Slayer",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Once per game, during the day, publicly choose a player: if they are the Demon, they die."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Soldier",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"You are safe from the Demon."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Mayor",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If only 3 players live & no execution occurs, your team wins. If you die at night, another player might die instead."],["","      ",{text:"OUTSIDER",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Drunk",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"You do not know you are the Drunk. You think you are a Townsfolk character, but you are not."],["","      ",{text:"OUTSIDER",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Recluse",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"You might register as evil & as a Minion or Demon, even if dead."],["","      ",{text:"OUTSIDER",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Moonchild",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"When you learn that you died, publicly choose 1 alive player. Tonight, if it was a good player, they die."],["","      ",{text:"OUTSIDER",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Barber",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If you died today or tonight, the Demon may choose 2 players (not another Demon) to swap characters."],["","      ",{text:"MINION",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Poisoner",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"Each night, choose a player: they are poisoned tonight and tomorrow day."],["","      ",{text:"MINION",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Scarlet Woman",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"If there are 5 or more players alive & the Demon dies, you become the Demon. (Travellers don't count.)"],["","      ",{text:"MINION",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Baron",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"There are extra Outsiders in play. [+2 Outsiders]"],["","      ",{text:"MINION",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Witch",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"Each night, choose a player: if they nominate tomorrow, they die. If just 3 players live, you lose this ability."],["","      ",{text:"DEMON",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Imp",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"Each night*, choose a player: they die. If you kill yourself this way, a Minion becomes the Imp."],["","      ",{text:"DEMON",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Fang Gu",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"Each night*, choose a player: they die. The 1st Outsider this kills becomes an evil Fang Gu & you die instead. [+1 Outsider]"],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:gold,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",["",{text:"Scarlet Woman",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/\n   ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Fang Gu",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red}],{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"If the Fang Gu chooses an Outsider and dies, the Scarlet Woman does not become the Fang Gu."]],title:"",author:""},custom_name={text:"Roll the Dice and Die Script",bold:true,italic:false,underlined:true,color:green},lore=[{text:"Useful role cheat sheet for ",italic:false,color:gray},[{text:"Roll the Dice and Die",italic:false,color:green},{text:" script.",italic:false,color:gray}]]]